        "content": "## 2. Debate loop\nDebater answers, Reviewer checks. On objections the Debater revises until the Reviewer agrees or `maxRounds` is reached."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "106fcd51-f94c-40c7-942a-ab4157cc3147",
      "name": "Section: judge",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        260,
        -340
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 680,
        "height": 800,
        "content": "## 3. Judge\nA third provider approves or rejects. A rejection starts a new cycle with the Judge's reason."
      },
